## What it costs

::::box{class=lead}
Every number here comes from a script in the repository that regenerates it. The decorative
gradient behind the headline is a foreign component, and it is counted too.
::::

::::box{class=cost-panel}

::island{from="./islands/cost.js" export="Cost"}

:::box{class=numbers}

:::metric[conformance examples, green]
692
:::

:::metric[gzipped runtime, when used]
591 B
:::

:::metric[JavaScript for a static document]
0 B
:::

:::metric[this page's decorative hero]
15 kB
:::

:::metric[display face, subset to Latin]
14 kB
:::

:::metric[packages, one boundary each]
7
:::

:::

